<Slide padding={60} style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 72, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 24, background: '#1E4FA8' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>选题价值 · 谁会用到它</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#CADCFC', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.2, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>02 · Topic</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }}></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 497, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 40, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>价值不在于做一个更会聊天的机器人，而在于让智能体贴着课程与复习流程发挥作用。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 14 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 272, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', gap: 12 }}><Box style={{ width: 372, height: 272, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>01</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>对在校学生</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>把课件、错题与计划收进同一课程空间；提问不再从零开始，复习按日推进，薄弱点可反复回看。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 372, height: 272, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>02</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>对课程助教</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>同一套演示模式可在无密钥环境复现全流程；逐日计划、错因分析与导出结果便于核对辅导效果。</Text></Box><Box style={{ width: 372, height: 272, background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', padding: 20, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ width: 30, height: 30, background: '#1E4FA8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.0, margin: 0, marginTop: 0, textAlign: 'center' }}>03</Text></Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 24, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>对课程验收</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.55, margin: 0, marginTop: 14 }}>功能、接口、验收判据与回归证据一一对应；未实现项在第 11 章单列，不做无法兑现的承诺。</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, marginTop: 14 }}><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 48, background: '#E8EFF8', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: 16 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>价值边界：以上是 V1.5.0 已实现能力带来的用途；长文档记忆、多用户等仍属未来期望（见 P05 愿景）。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 34, flexDirection: 'column', marginTop: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1.4, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>价值结论：轻量化、易部署、可逐条验收，比功能数量更适合作为课程作业的选题落点。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 30, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>AI 校园学习陪伴助手  ·  课程作业答辩</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8', fontWeight: 'normal', lineHeight: 1.3, margin: 0, marginTop: 0 }}>09 / 28</Text></Box></Slide>